      "type": "text",
      "x": 101.86000000000001,
      "y": 213.75,
      "width": 676.28,
      "height": 192.5,
      "text": "GEMINI MAY\n\n• read Tamil, Tanglish and English\n• extract facts the student actually said\n  (class, community, state, gender, income figure...)\n• answer a small side question, in her language\n  (\"where do I get an income certificate?\")",
      "originalText": "GEMINI MAY\n\n• read Tamil, Tanglish and English\n• extract facts the student actually said\n  (class, community, state, gender, income figure...)\n• answer a small side question, in her language\n  (\"where do I get an income certificate?\")",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 20,
      "containerId": "el2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
