      "id": "el5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 986.52,
      "y": 186.25,
      "width": 586.9599999999999,
      "height": 247.5,
      "text": "GEMINI NEVER\n\n• decides eligibility (the rule engine does)\n• states scheme facts: amounts, dates, rules\n• guesses income from a job (\"appa coolie\")\n• turns \"OBC\" into a Tamil Nadu community\n• sets a value that bundles two facts\n  when only one was said (govt-aided + medium)\n• asks for or keeps Aadhaar / ID numbers",
      "originalText": "GEMINI NEVER\n\n• decides eligibility (the rule engine does)\n• states scheme facts: amounts, dates, rules\n• guesses income from a job (\"appa coolie\")\n• turns \"OBC\" into a Tamil Nadu community\n• sets a value that bundles two facts\n  when only one was said (govt-aided + medium)\n• asks for or keeps Aadhaar / ID numbers",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 20,
      "containerId": "el4",
